{"seq":3,"slug":"agent-security","title":"Agent 安全工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/production-deployment/agent-security","wordCount":1150,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"agent-安全工程\">Agent 安全工程</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Agent 安全是 AI 系统工程中最关键的横切关注点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么-agent-安全特殊\">为什么 Agent 安全特殊</h3><ul>\n<li>Agent 拥有调用工具、访问数据和执行操作的能力</li>\n<li>一旦被恶意利用或出现非预期行为，可能造成数据泄露、资源滥用甚至系统破坏</li>\n<li>Agent 安全工程涵盖输入防护、输出过滤、权限控制和行为约束四个层面</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[用户输入]--&gt;B[输入防护层]&#10;    B--&gt;C[Agent 推理]&#10;    C--&gt;D[工具权限控制]&#10;    D--&gt;E[工具执行]&#10;    E--&gt;F[输出过滤层]&#10;    F--&gt;G[用户响应]&#10;    C--&gt;H[行为约束]&#10;    H--&gt;C\">flowchart TD\n    A[用户输入]--&gt;B[输入防护层]\n    B--&gt;C[Agent 推理]\n    C--&gt;D[工具权限控制]\n    D--&gt;E[工具执行]\n    E--&gt;F[输出过滤层]\n    F--&gt;G[用户响应]\n    C--&gt;H[行为约束]\n    H--&gt;C</pre><h3 id=\"威胁全景\">威胁全景</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>威胁类型</th>\n<th>攻击方式</th>\n<th>潜在影响</th>\n<th>防护策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提示注入</td>\n<td>在输入中嵌入指令覆盖系统提示</td>\n<td>Agent 行为偏离</td>\n<td>输入清洗、指令隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>间接注入</td>\n<td>通过工具返回数据注入指令</td>\n<td>工具链被劫持</td>\n<td>结果过滤、沙箱隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限提升</td>\n<td>利用工具链获取未授权访问</td>\n<td>数据泄露</td>\n<td>最小权限、白名单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源耗尽</td>\n<td>构造触发无限循环的查询</td>\n<td>服务不可用</td>\n<td>迭代限制、超时控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据泄露</td>\n<td>诱导 Agent 暴露系统信息</td>\n<td>隐私泄露</td>\n<td>输出过滤、脱敏处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社会工程</td>\n<td>利用角色扮演绕过约束</td>\n<td>安全策略失效</td>\n<td>多层防御、行为审计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"提示注入防护\">提示注入防护</h2><p>提示注入是 Agent 系统面临的最普遍威胁。攻击者试图在用户输入中嵌入指令来覆盖系统提示，改变 Agent 的预期行为。</p>\n<h3 id=\"注入模式库\">注入模式库</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>注入模式</th>\n<th>特征示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>指令覆盖</td>\n<td>ignore previous instructions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>角色重定义</td>\n<td>you are now ...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统消息伪造</td>\n<td>system: ...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特殊标记注入</td>\n<td><code>[INST]</code>、<code>&lt;|im_start|&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记忆清除</td>\n<td>forget everything</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则绕过</td>\n<td>do not follow the rules</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>角色伪装</td>\n<td>pretend you are ...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提示泄露</td>\n<td>output your system prompt</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"分级处置\">分级处置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const processUserInput = (input: string) =&gt; {&#10;  const check = detector(input);&#10;  if (check.riskLevel === &#39;high&#39;) {&#10;    return { blocked: true, reason: &#39;高风险注入&#39; };&#10;  }&#10;  if (check.riskLevel === &#39;medium&#39;) {&#10;    return { sanitizedInput: sanitizeInput(input) };&#10;  }&#10;  return { blocked: false, input };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processUserInput</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> detector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (check.riskLevel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { blocked: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'高风险注入'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (check.riskLevel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { sanitizedInput: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sanitizeInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { blocked: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, input };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>风险等级按命中模式数量分级：0 = none、1 = low、2-3 = medium、&gt;3 = high</li>\n<li>medium 时清洗特殊标记后放行，high 时直接拦截</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"纵深防御\">纵深防御</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>防御层</th>\n<th>手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入层</td>\n<td>正则模式检测 + 清洗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理循环</td>\n<td>监控行为异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>辅助检测</td>\n<td>LLM 辅助检测 + 行为分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>单靠正则匹配无法防御所有攻击，必须多层组合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"权限与访问控制\">权限与访问控制</h2><p>Agent 的工具访问权限应该遵循最小权限原则——每个 Agent 只能访问完成其任务所需的最小资源集。</p>\n<h3 id=\"角色定义示例\">角色定义示例</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>可访问资源</th>\n<th>速率上限</th>\n<th>单次成本上限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>reader</td>\n<td>数据库只读（白名单表）、文件只读（.md/.txt）</td>\n<td>30 次/分钟</td>\n<td>$0.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>writer</td>\n<td>数据库读写（drafts/reviews）、文件读写、API</td>\n<td>50 次/分钟</td>\n<td>$0.5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"权限检查实现\">权限检查实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const checkPermission = (role, res, act) =&gt; {&#10;  const r = roles.get(role);&#10;  if (!r) {&#10;    return deny(&#39;未知角色&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;  const perm = permOf(r, res);&#10;  if (!perm || !canDo(perm, act)) {&#10;    return deny(&#39;无权限&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;  return { allowed: true };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> checkPermission</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">res</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">act</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> roles.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(role);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deny</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'未知角色'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> perm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> permOf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r, res);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">perm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">canDo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(perm, act)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deny</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'无权限'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { allowed: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"权限模型选型\">权限模型选型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>权限模型</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>管理复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基于角色（RBAC）</td>\n<td>角色级</td>\n<td>标准场景</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基于属性（ABAC）</td>\n<td>属性级</td>\n<td>细粒度控制</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基于策略（PBAC）</td>\n<td>策略级</td>\n<td>复杂规则</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小权限 + 即时授权</td>\n<td>操作级</td>\n<td>高安全要求</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"输出安全与内容过滤\">输出安全与内容过滤</h2><p>Agent 的输出同样需要安全检查，防止泄露敏感信息或生成有害内容。</p>\n<h3 id=\"两类过滤器\">两类过滤器</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>过滤器</th>\n<th>检测对象</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>个人信息脱敏</td>\n<td>手机号、邮箱、身份证</td>\n<td>替换为掩码继续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统信息泄露</td>\n<td>api_key、password、私钥块等凭证</td>\n<td>直接拦截输出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"过滤管道\">过滤管道</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Agent 输出]--&gt;B{过滤器检查}&#10;    B--&gt;|安全|C[直接输出]&#10;    B--&gt;|可脱敏|D[替换掩码+告警]&#10;    D--&gt;C&#10;    B--&gt;|不可脱敏|E[整体拦截]\">flowchart TD\n    A[Agent 输出]--&gt;B{过滤器检查}\n    B--&gt;|安全|C[直接输出]\n    B--&gt;|可脱敏|D[替换掩码+告警]\n    D--&gt;C\n    B--&gt;|不可脱敏|E[整体拦截]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"for (const filter of filters) {&#10;  const c = filter.check(result);&#10;  if (!c.safe &amp;&amp; c.sanitized) {&#10;    result = c.sanitized;&#10;  } else if (!c.safe) {&#10;    return blocked();&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> filter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> filters) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> filter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">c.safe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.sanitized) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.sanitized;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">c.safe) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> blocked</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内容类别</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可脱敏（个人信息）</td>\n<td>替换后继续输出并附告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可脱敏（凭证、私钥）</td>\n<td>整体拦截</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"行为审计与合规\">行为审计与合规</h2><p>完整的行为审计日志是安全事件调查和合规证明的基础。</p>\n<h3 id=\"审计条目结构\">审计条目结构</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>sessionId</code>/<code>userId</code></td>\n<td>谁在什么会话里操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>action</code>/<code>resource</code></td>\n<td>做了什么、对什么资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>input</code>/<code>output</code></td>\n<td>完整输入输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>toolCalls</code></td>\n<td>工具调用链（工具、参数、结果）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>riskFlags</code></td>\n<td>命中的风险标记</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"敏感字段脱敏\">敏感字段脱敏</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const redactSensitive = (obj) =&gt; {&#10;  const redacted = { ...obj };&#10;  for (const field of config.sensitiveFields) {&#10;    if (field in redacted) {&#10;      redacted[field] = &#39;[REDACTED]&#39;;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  return redacted;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> redactSensitive</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">obj</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> redacted</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">obj };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> field</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.sensitiveFields) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (field </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> redacted) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      redacted[field] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '[REDACTED]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> redacted;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>写入存储前对工具调用参数中的敏感字段统一打码，审计日志本身不能成为新的泄露源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Agent 安全工程涵盖输入防护、输出过滤、权限控制和行为约束四个层面</li>\n<li>提示注入防护需要纵深防御——正则检测 + LLM 辅助分析 + 行为监控</li>\n<li>权限控制遵循最小权限原则，每个 Agent 只能访问完成任务所需的最小资源集</li>\n<li>输出安全包括个人信息脱敏、凭证检测和有害内容过滤</li>\n<li>行为审计日志是安全事件调查和合规证明的基础，需要记录完整的工具调用链路</li>\n<li>安全是持续的过程，需要定期进行红队测试和安全评估</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Agent 安全工程","id":"agent-安全工程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么 Agent 安全特殊","id":"为什么-agent-安全特殊"},{"level":3,"text":"威胁全景","id":"威胁全景"},{"level":2,"text":"提示注入防护","id":"提示注入防护"},{"level":3,"text":"注入模式库","id":"注入模式库"},{"level":3,"text":"分级处置","id":"分级处置"},{"level":3,"text":"纵深防御","id":"纵深防御"},{"level":2,"text":"权限与访问控制","id":"权限与访问控制"},{"level":3,"text":"角色定义示例","id":"角色定义示例"},{"level":3,"text":"权限检查实现","id":"权限检查实现"},{"level":3,"text":"权限模型选型","id":"权限模型选型"},{"level":2,"text":"输出安全与内容过滤","id":"输出安全与内容过滤"},{"level":3,"text":"两类过滤器","id":"两类过滤器"},{"level":3,"text":"过滤管道","id":"过滤管道"},{"level":2,"text":"行为审计与合规","id":"行为审计与合规"},{"level":3,"text":"审计条目结构","id":"审计条目结构"},{"level":3,"text":"敏感字段脱敏","id":"敏感字段脱敏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Agent 扩展与性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/production-deployment/scaling-agents"},"next":null}